    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >four retro styled games in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Athena's show and test your reflexes by dodging falling tomatoes with ever increasing speed in a game inspired by the Game and Watch games of the 1990s/1980s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/f5363901a9f257d96c5c27b6d45efbac.poster.avif?t=1749269049\" width=384 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/f5363901a9f257d96c5c27b6d45efbac.webm?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/f5363901a9f257d96c5c27b6d45efbac.mp4?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your management skills and Keep leaks down by whacking them before pressure runs out in Athena's steamworks: A &quot;Whack a Mole&quot; styled game with a twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/cabab30dee18df93746cb00fa47763e2.poster.avif?t=1749269049\" width=384 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/cabab30dee18df93746cb00fa47763e2.webm?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 30 stars while avoiding hazards each level in the platformer Athena's highwire: Inspired by Arcade<strong> collectathons</strong> games such as Mappy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/1f782421480ab25c2fa146c0d53454f1.poster.avif?t=1749269049\" width=392 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/1f782421480ab25c2fa146c0d53454f1.webm?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/1f782421480ab25c2fa146c0d53454f1.mp4?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now with the exclusive remake of my Atari homebrew: Athena's cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breakout x space invaders inspired game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/aaf4fe5ae3bdd5edc2782bd807139bdd.avif?t=1749269049\" width=800 height=728 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Currently Athena's Highwire rases a false flag with mcafee, Apparently, it's a clickteam issue)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >four retro styled games in one!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Athena's show and test your reflexes by dodging falling tomatoes with ever increasing speed in a game inspired by the Game and Watch games of the 1990s/1980s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/f5363901a9f257d96c5c27b6d45efbac.poster.avif?t=1749269049\" width=384 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/f5363901a9f257d96c5c27b6d45efbac.webm?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/f5363901a9f257d96c5c27b6d45efbac.mp4?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your management skills and Keep leaks down by whacking them before pressure runs out in Athena's steamworks: A &quot;Whack a Mole&quot; styled game with a twist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/cabab30dee18df93746cb00fa47763e2.poster.avif?t=1749269049\" width=384 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/cabab30dee18df93746cb00fa47763e2.webm?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 30 stars while avoiding hazards each level in the platformer Athena's highwire: Inspired by Arcade<strong> collectathons</strong> games such as Mappy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/1f782421480ab25c2fa146c0d53454f1.poster.avif?t=1749269049\" width=392 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/1f782421480ab25c2fa146c0d53454f1.webm?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/1f782421480ab25c2fa146c0d53454f1.mp4?t=1749269049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now with the exclusive remake of my Atari homebrew: Athena's cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A breakout x space invaders inspired game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542820/extras/aaf4fe5ae3bdd5edc2782bd807139bdd.avif?t=1749269049\" width=800 height=728 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Currently Athena's Highwire rases a false flag with mcafee, Apparently, it's a clickteam issue)</p>",
